{"id":30628089176,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAHIZONWA","head_branch":"fix/invalid-duration-dvs-43_2.43","head_sha":"49c0b2f74a5de1e886ba86043e1894d4bb94b092","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":51600,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"backport: fix: reject invalid/negative lastUpdatedDuration on dataValueSets export instead of silently ignoring it","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":83055322775,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAATVnumlw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30628089176","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30628089176","pull_requests":[{"id":4177409810,"number":24683,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/pulls/24683","head":{"ref":"fix/invalid-duration-dvs-43_2.43","sha":"49c0b2f74a5de1e886ba86043e1894d4bb94b092","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}},"base":{"ref":"2.43","sha":"323d5e2f6e9f53d30cfac958cfeb7b05d7a671f3","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}}}],"created_at":"2026-07-31T11:44:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T11:57:21Z","run_started_at":"2026-07-31T11:44:23Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30628089176/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30628089176/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/83055322775","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30628089176/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30628089176/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30628089176/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: reject invalid/negative lastUpdatedDuration on dataValueSets export instead of silently ignoring it (#24470)\n\n* fix: reject invalid/negative lastUpdatedDuration on dataValueSets export instead of silently ignoring it\n\nDateUtils.getDuration() returns null on any parse failure (its regex requires\nunsigned digits, so negative durations like \"-5d\" never match), and\nDefaultDataExportService.decodeParams() called it unchecked, so a malformed or\nnegative lastUpdatedDuration was silently discarded - indistinguishable from\n\"not provided\". If it was the client's only time filter, this surfaced as the\nunrelated E2002 error instead of pointing at the actual problem; otherwise it\nwas dropped with no error at all.\n\nErrorCode.E2005 (\"Duration is not valid: `{0}`\") already exists for exactly\nthis and is used by the sibling DefaultCompleteDataSetRegistrationExchangeService\nfor its createdDuration parameter, but was never wired up here.\n\ndecodeParams() now throws ConflictException(E2005, rawValue) when\nlastUpdatedDuration is non-blank but fails to parse. lastUpdatedDuration=0d\nis deliberately left valid - it parses successfully (Duration.ZERO) and is a\nwell-defined (if narrow) \"as of right now\" filter, analogous to\nstartDate == endDate being a valid zero-width date range.\n\nVerified via mutation testing: temporarily disabled the new guard, confirmed\nonly the two negative-case tests failed (the 0d-is-valid test stayed green),\nthen restored. No regressions in DataExportServiceExportTest,\nDataValueServiceTest, or DataValueSetControllerTest.\n\nRelated to DHIS2-21821.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n* fix: reduce decodeParams cognitive complexity and cover blank duration branch\n\nExtracts attribute-option-combo, order, and lastUpdatedDuration resolution\ninto their own methods so decodeParams stays under the complexity limit,\nand adds a test for the blank (non-null) lastUpdatedDuration case that the\nisBlank() guard exists to handle.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"49c0b2f74a5de1e886ba86043e1894d4bb94b092","tree_id":"0aaa1f54247d55f637e1fd5195a9f7e96bdc40bc","timestamp":"2026-07-31T11:44:15Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web API.","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core","fork":false,"private":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/{archive_format}{/ref}","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/git/blobs{/sha}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/branches{/branch}","collaborators_url"